  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kvinnliga politikers inflytande NDI 2009-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s Political Influence NDI 2009-2016 - NDI 2009-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till kvinnors politiska representation och inflytande i Burkina  Faso, genom bl a utbildningar med kvinnliga politiska ledare,         uppmuntran av k&#xf6;nskvotering vid politiska val, genderk&#xe4;nslig          budgetering i parlamentet, samt en st&#xe4;rkt koalition f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;rande  och uppf&#xf6;ljning av CEDAW.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to women&apos;s political representation and influence in Burkina  Faso, through for example training women leaders, promoting gender    quota during political elections, gender-sensitive budgeting in       parliament and a strengthened coalition for implementation and        monitoring of the CEDAW.</narrative>
  </description>
